{"sections":[{"slug":"Dold–Kan对应","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Dold–Kan对应"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Dold–Kan <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Dold–Kan 对应"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Dold–Kan <span lang=\"zh\">对应是某些</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯</span>"}},{"Plain":" Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群之间的等价</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3>1-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴版本</span></h3>\n<p>Abel <span lang=\"zh\">单纯群等价于连合的</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群链复形</span>:\n$$\r\nN \\colon  \\mathsf {sAb} \\rightleftarrows \\mathsf {Ch}^+(\\mathsf {Ab})\\colon \\Gamma,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Moore复形","text":"Moore <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>∞–<span lang=\"zh\">范畴版本</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则有等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathbb{Z}_{\\geq 0},\\mathcal C) \\simeq\\mathsf {Fun}(\\Delta^{\\text{op}},\\mathcal C).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个等价与同伦范畴的</span> Dold–Kan <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span> $\\mathsf {Ch}(h\\mathcal C)_{\\geq 0}\\simeq \\mathsf {Fun}(\\Delta^{\\text{op}},h\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">相容</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">借助</span> Dold–Kan <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">构造</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}